{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03770","headline":"和韦承庆过义阳公主山池五首 五 · 杜审言","name":"和韦承庆过义阳公主山池五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赏翫期他日，高深爱此时。\n池分八水背，峰作九山疑。\n地静鱼偏逸，人闲鸟欲欺。\n青溪留别兴，更与白云期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜审言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03770.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03770","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}